{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q20054536","formula":"C₉H₂₀O₂","hill":"C9H20O2","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":9.0,"H":20.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"1,9-nonanediol","ru":"Нонандиол-1,9"},"descriptions":{"en":"1,9-Nonanediol, also known as nonamethylene glycol, is a diol with the molecular formula HO(CH2)9OH. It is a colorless solid, which is sparingly soluble in water but readily soluble in ethanol. 1,9-nonanediol can be produced by isomerization of allyl alcohol. It can also be obtained by reacting methyl oleate with triethylsilyl hydrotrioxide and lithium aluminum hydride.","ru":"1,9-Нонандиол (нонаметиленгликоль) — химическое соединение из класса двухатомных спиртов с химической формулой C9H20O2. Это бесцветное твёрдое вещество, которое слабо растворимо в воде, но легко растворимо в этаноле. 1,9-Нонандиол может быть получен путем изомеризации аллилового спирта."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":19835,"mass":160.25,"charge":0,"smiles":"C(CCCCO)CCCCO","inchikey":"ALVZNPYWJMLXKV-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"nonane-1,9-diol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"19835","atoms":31,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-6.225,"y":0.416,"z":0.001,"el":"O"},{"x":6.227,"y":0.384,"z":0.028,"el":"O"},{"x":0.003,"y":-0.473,"z":-0.009,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.287,"y":0.353,"z":-0.018,"el":"C"},{"x":1.272,"y":0.383,"z":-0.035,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.558,"y":-0.499,"z":0.03,"el":"C"},{"x":2.562,"y":-0.444,"z":-0.026,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.814,"y":0.38,"z":-0.001,"el":"C"},{"x":3.831,"y":0.405,"z":0.026,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.095,"y":-0.445,"z":0.012,"el":"C"},{"x":5.084,"y":-0.46,"z":-0.008,"el":"C"},{"x":0.005,"y":-1.147,"z":-0.875,"el":"H"},{"x":0.016,"y":-1.108,"z":0.886,"el":"H"},{"x":-1.304,"y":0.977,"z":-0.921,"el":"H"},{"x":-1.28,"y":1.038,"z":0.839,"el":"H"},{"x":1.27,"y":1.052,"z":0.834,"el":"